 "_readme": [
  "MALL OPENINGS TRACKER — the China-origin share of NEW store openings at 25 of the top US malls.",
  "",
  "METHOD: periodically read each mall's own online directory and capture EVERY tenant tagged",
  "'New' / 'Now Open' / 'Coming Soon' (the openings). Flag each as china_origin (matched to the",
  "register's tracked China-origin chains) or not. The headline metric = china-origin openings /",
  "all captured openings, across malls whose latest sweep is 'complete' (captured ALL new tags).",
  "",
  "Universe is '25 of the top US malls' (by size/prominence) — NOT 'all US malls'. Because top",
  "malls skew premium/Asian-metro, the china-origin share runs higher than an all-US-mall average;",
  "label it precisely. Pop-ups and temporary activations are NOT counted as openings.",
  "",
  "'complete': true = this sweep captured the mall's full New/Coming-Soon set (counts toward the",
  "denominator). false = only the china-origin openings were captured (numerator only; excluded",
  "from the share). Use the LATEST sweep per mall. status: 'open' (now open) | 'coming_soon'.",
  "Internal source file; the computed metric is exported + shown on the public site."
 ],
